WEBVTT

00:09.944 --> 00:11.944
mkvdrama.me

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.056 --> 01:43.199
=Episode 23=
(The Boy from Yifeng Alley Always Has the Upper Hand)

01:48.346 --> 01:50.520
(Qingyi Central Hospital)
(National Class A Tertiary Hospital)

01:50.616 --> 01:51.817
Is this more comfortable?

01:52.457 --> 01:52.897
Alright.

01:52.897 --> 01:53.656
- It's okay.
- Mr. Xu.

01:53.897 --> 01:54.937
Here's the water.

01:55.096 --> 01:56.096
Okay.

01:56.656 --> 01:57.656
Dad, have some water.

01:58.256 --> 01:58.656
Okay.

01:58.656 --> 01:59.136
Ms. Wei.

01:59.656 --> 02:00.977
How about we take care of Mr. Xu?

02:00.977 --> 02:01.977
You go ahead.

02:02.216 --> 02:03.216
Okay.

02:04.296 --> 02:05.616
Alright, then I'll get busy.

02:05.897 --> 02:06.256
Okay.

02:06.497 --> 02:07.576
I'll come after work.

02:07.776 --> 02:08.776
You'll take care of him.

02:09.576 --> 02:10.857
Want an orange, Mr. Xu?

02:11.457 --> 02:12.457
Sure.

02:14.176 --> 02:14.656
Xu.

02:15.096 --> 02:16.296
Look who's here.

02:17.937 --> 02:19.696
Fu, what brings you here?

02:20.176 --> 02:22.176
What's going on here?

02:23.497 --> 02:23.977
Wait.

02:24.337 --> 02:25.337
Don't touch.

02:25.656 --> 02:26.337
You two chat.

02:26.656 --> 02:28.136
I have work to do. I'll get busy now.

02:28.377 --> 02:29.377
Okay, go ahead.

02:29.736 --> 02:30.377
Take a rain check.

02:30.377 --> 02:31.377
Okay.

02:31.776 --> 02:33.136
Just ignore him.

02:34.057 --> 02:35.776
What's going on here?

02:36.296 --> 02:37.296
Who did this to you?

02:37.457 --> 02:38.338
The delivery guy.

02:38.338 --> 02:40.337
The electric scooter came by in a flash.

02:40.616 --> 02:41.616
Where's the person?

02:42.017 --> 02:43.017
Gone?

02:45.296 --> 02:47.017
Your dad is such a nice guy.

02:49.256 --> 02:51.216
Why don't you greet me?

02:52.616 --> 02:53.616
Come on.

02:54.377 --> 02:55.857
Wish me a Happy New Year,

02:56.057 --> 02:57.057
and this will be yours.

02:59.017 --> 03:00.057
Not interested.

03:04.296 --> 03:05.296
Don't you even want it?

03:07.616 --> 03:08.616
Just say hello.

03:18.256 --> 03:21.017
You'll have to listen to your boyfriend

03:21.017 --> 03:22.296
to greet me now?

03:23.497 --> 03:24.497
Okay.

03:24.736 --> 03:25.736
Chen.

03:26.216 --> 03:27.457
Then you talk to her.

03:28.337 --> 03:29.337
Here.

03:29.736 --> 03:30.736
Mr. Xu.

03:31.057 --> 03:31.776
Since he's here,

03:31.776 --> 03:32.776
I'll leave.

03:33.296 --> 03:34.537
Don't eat in the cafeteria.

03:34.696 --> 03:35.857
Zhi and I will bring it here.

03:36.296 --> 03:37.296
Alright.

03:37.776 --> 03:38.776
Then you...

03:39.937 --> 03:41.017
Just go back together.

03:41.897 --> 03:42.897
Okay.

03:45.057 --> 03:46.256
Go to bed early.

03:56.776 --> 03:58.216
What was that?

03:59.817 --> 04:01.216
What's going on with Xu Zhi?

04:01.977 --> 04:03.296
Being with Chen Luzhou,

04:03.296 --> 04:04.656
she's changed so much.

04:04.656 --> 04:06.216
Do something.

04:07.377 --> 04:08.817
I can't give out the red envelope.

04:09.377 --> 04:10.937
Then I'll keep it for her.

04:12.776 --> 04:13.656
It's for her.

04:13.776 --> 04:14.776
That's a lot of money.

04:15.096 --> 04:16.377
His name is Chen Luzhou.

04:16.937 --> 04:18.857
What's so special about Chen Luzhou?

04:20.017 --> 04:21.017
He's impolite.

04:21.457 --> 04:23.576
He's the biological son of Lian Hui.

04:33.897 --> 04:35.256
Don't think too much about it.

04:35.497 --> 04:36.378
If he knew,

04:36.378 --> 04:38.057
he would definitely deeply regret it.

04:39.457 --> 04:40.857
Don't worry.

04:42.776 --> 04:43.697
I just consider him

04:43.697 --> 04:44.857
as a long dead one

04:45.377 --> 04:46.696
who recently came back to life.

04:46.696 --> 04:47.696
I'm a bit unused to it.

04:48.176 --> 04:49.176
Alright.

04:49.457 --> 04:51.296
I thought you didn't know
how to face him.

04:52.937 --> 04:53.696
He's a stranger.

04:53.776 --> 04:54.776
Pay him no attention.

04:56.457 --> 04:56.897
Let's go.

04:57.457 --> 04:58.457
Accompany me to a place.

04:58.616 --> 04:59.616
What place?

05:01.256 --> 05:02.977
First step to win over my father-in-law.

05:03.497 --> 05:03.817
Okay.

05:03.817 --> 05:04.817
Conquer his stomach.

05:06.457 --> 05:07.457
Let's go!

05:11.696 --> 05:12.696
Chen Luzhou.

05:14.696 --> 05:16.696
I think I know
how you'll look when you age.

05:17.057 --> 05:18.057
How will I look?

05:19.776 --> 05:21.136
A charming one.

05:23.897 --> 05:25.136
You've fallen in love with me.

05:25.977 --> 05:27.537
Then we should get married.

05:27.696 --> 05:28.696
Indeed.

05:29.176 --> 05:30.696
Why don't you propose to me now?

05:31.096 --> 05:32.656
Maybe I'll agree on a whim.

05:39.256 --> 05:41.256
Dear Chen Luzhou,

05:42.457 --> 05:43.457
you...

05:44.337 --> 05:45.537
Have some self-respect.

05:50.457 --> 05:51.497
Do you still have

05:52.337 --> 05:53.217
the puppy I gave you?

05:53.217 --> 05:54.256
Of course, there it is.

05:55.176 --> 05:56.176
Alright.

05:56.256 --> 05:57.977
This is my first handmade craft.

05:58.537 --> 05:59.937
Keep it safe and don't lose it.

06:00.937 --> 06:01.937
Stop nagging.

06:02.216 --> 06:02.696
Okay.

06:02.817 --> 06:03.817
Go out.

06:04.057 --> 06:05.057
Leave it to me.

06:10.656 --> 06:11.656
Go out.

06:12.176 --> 06:13.817
Go to your place
after delivering the meal.

06:14.736 --> 06:16.256
Aren't you afraid
your dad will break your leg?

06:16.256 --> 06:17.776
Let him take care of himself first.

06:48.136 --> 06:49.216
Hi, please sit here.

06:49.216 --> 06:49.696
Thank you.

06:49.696 --> 06:50.696
You're welcome.

06:59.817 --> 07:01.817
Here, your favorite Da Hong Pao tea.

07:07.057 --> 07:08.337
I quit tea long ago.

07:20.656 --> 07:21.736
What happened in the past

07:22.656 --> 07:23.897
was all my fault.

07:24.417 --> 07:25.417
I'm sorry.

07:27.696 --> 07:28.696
Otherwise?

07:31.377 --> 07:33.136
I was too reckless

07:33.136 --> 07:34.136
and unreliable

07:34.616 --> 07:35.616
in my youth.

07:37.377 --> 07:39.776
I didn't fulfill my responsibilities
as a father.

07:40.857 --> 07:41.857
I pushed you to the limit

07:42.337 --> 07:43.576
where you had no choice.

07:44.216 --> 07:45.216
You could only tell me

07:45.696 --> 07:47.057
the child was adopted by others.

07:51.216 --> 07:52.977
Actually, I saw him

07:53.417 --> 07:54.417
at my villa last year.

07:55.337 --> 07:56.337
Really a handsome,

07:57.096 --> 07:58.096
well-mannered,

07:58.656 --> 07:59.736
sensible and capable guy

08:00.017 --> 08:01.136
with his own ideas.

08:01.937 --> 08:04.057
You clearly raised him well.

08:07.497 --> 08:08.497
All these years,

08:09.337 --> 08:10.337
you've worked hard.

08:14.176 --> 08:16.057
Now you're suddenly
saying these nice things,

08:16.617 --> 08:17.617
so what's the point?

08:20.176 --> 08:22.017
Actually, sending him to the orphanage

08:22.017 --> 08:23.256
wasn't my original intention.

08:24.456 --> 08:25.697
I went to look for him.

08:25.937 --> 08:26.897
You know this.

08:26.897 --> 08:27.897
I know.

08:29.897 --> 08:31.496
I know you didn't remember

08:31.496 --> 08:32.496
his looks.

08:38.216 --> 08:39.977
I invited you over

08:41.777 --> 08:42.937
to discuss

08:42.937 --> 08:44.937
how I can make it up to you two.

08:45.096 --> 08:46.096
Make it up?

08:46.577 --> 08:47.577
How to make it up?

08:48.017 --> 08:49.057
My villa.

08:50.096 --> 08:51.096
Give it to him.

08:51.897 --> 08:52.897
I'll do my best

08:53.857 --> 08:55.096
to give him whatever I have.

09:01.777 --> 09:02.937
Do you think he'll want it?

09:04.536 --> 09:05.657
If he doesn't want it,

09:06.977 --> 09:07.977
I will give it to Xu Zhi.

09:08.376 --> 09:09.376
The two of them...

09:09.697 --> 09:10.737
Fu Yuqing.

09:11.657 --> 09:12.857
Bonding with your son

09:12.857 --> 09:14.096
isn't that simple.

09:14.096 --> 09:15.018
You give him something.

09:15.018 --> 09:16.536
I nod and he'll agree.
It's not the case.

09:18.017 --> 09:19.456
Luzhou isn't a child now.

09:19.456 --> 09:21.057
He has his own cognition and judgment.

09:26.577 --> 09:27.577
Right.

09:29.697 --> 09:30.697
You're right.

09:31.657 --> 09:32.817
Got anything else to say?

09:39.256 --> 09:40.937
He and Xu Zhi

09:41.216 --> 09:42.216
are quite well?

09:44.857 --> 09:47.176
Whether they are well or not
doesn't seem to concern you.

09:51.256 --> 09:52.496
If nothing else, I'll go.

10:18.017 --> 10:18.698
Come.

10:18.698 --> 10:19.817
Just in time, take a look.

10:21.216 --> 10:23.017
My family's son-in-law.

10:23.017 --> 10:24.096
Look,

10:24.096 --> 10:25.336
he is handsome,

10:25.577 --> 10:26.577
and has good grades

10:26.657 --> 10:29.017
and remarkable cooking skills.

10:30.176 --> 10:30.977
You made this?

10:31.096 --> 10:32.096
Yes.

10:32.296 --> 10:33.296
Not bad.

10:33.657 --> 10:34.777
As long as Mr. Xu likes it.

10:35.017 --> 10:36.017
Of course.

10:37.336 --> 10:38.017
I'm not bragging.

10:38.176 --> 10:39.176
Do you want to try it?

10:44.817 --> 10:45.817
How is it?

10:50.456 --> 10:51.456
Not bad.

10:52.496 --> 10:53.737
When will you return to school?

10:53.937 --> 10:54.497
No rush.

10:54.497 --> 10:55.897
After you're discharged.

10:56.977 --> 10:58.376
I'm getting discharged tomorrow.

10:59.057 --> 10:59.777
I am thinking

11:00.057 --> 11:01.057
before you leave,

11:01.176 --> 11:02.216
I'll make you a meal.

11:02.897 --> 11:04.136
It'll be summer vacation

11:04.136 --> 11:05.336
the next time you come back.

11:05.977 --> 11:07.336
We may not return this summer.

11:07.657 --> 11:08.657
What's wrong?

11:08.817 --> 11:09.817
Planning to elope?

11:10.617 --> 11:12.256
Mr. Xu, I got
a drone photography project,

11:12.496 --> 11:13.617
and may not return.

11:13.697 --> 11:14.416
But Xu Zhi

11:14.496 --> 11:15.496
can come back.

11:15.977 --> 11:17.577
Didn't we agree on it last night?

11:17.577 --> 11:18.577
I'll go with you.

11:18.977 --> 11:20.057
I didn't agree with you.

11:23.136 --> 11:24.977
Don't get involved
in the children's matters.

11:25.296 --> 11:27.096
Being a third wheel isn't appropriate.

11:28.456 --> 11:29.017
Alright.

11:29.136 --> 11:30.136
Right.

11:30.416 --> 11:32.216
Anyway, after you go to Beijing,

11:33.017 --> 11:34.017
study well.

11:34.897 --> 11:38.216
If you run out of money, just call us.

11:39.256 --> 11:40.376
You can call me as well.

11:40.376 --> 11:40.777
Right.

11:41.336 --> 11:42.336
Mr. Cai is rich.

11:53.496 --> 11:54.496
Here.

12:01.096 --> 12:02.577
This is the first time my daughter

12:02.697 --> 12:04.176
brings her boyfriend home.

12:04.817 --> 12:06.017
Just in time for the New Year.

12:06.697 --> 12:07.697
These are

12:08.096 --> 12:10.376
from Mr. Cai and me.

12:10.657 --> 12:11.296
No need, Mr. Xu.

12:11.296 --> 12:11.737
I...

12:12.096 --> 12:12.577
Take it.

12:12.857 --> 12:14.017
Take it.

12:14.496 --> 12:15.256
If not,

12:15.456 --> 12:16.977
Xu Zhi won't get her share again.

12:17.657 --> 12:18.657
Take it.

12:19.617 --> 12:20.817
Take it.

12:21.456 --> 12:22.456
Alright.

12:23.017 --> 12:23.977
Thank you, Mr. Xu.

12:23.977 --> 12:24.977
Thank you, Mr. Cai.

12:27.296 --> 12:29.096
So, this extra one is...

12:29.577 --> 12:31.937
The extra one is from Mr. Cai.

12:32.216 --> 12:33.857
But there are three.

12:37.017 --> 12:38.857
You mean this one.

12:40.617 --> 12:41.617
It's from...

12:42.657 --> 12:43.657
Right.

12:48.657 --> 12:49.657
I'll keep yours.

12:50.456 --> 12:51.456
Let him take his back.

12:52.296 --> 12:53.817
There's no money in it.

12:54.737 --> 12:55.256
Not money?

12:55.536 --> 12:56.536
Then what is it?

12:57.216 --> 12:58.617
Just open it and check it out.

13:03.806 --> 13:06.166
(Happiness)

13:11.096 --> 13:12.096
Feeling good?

13:12.737 --> 13:15.256
Neither my dad nor Mr. Cai
ever gave me this much.

13:15.577 --> 13:16.777
Why should I feel good?

13:17.496 --> 13:18.617
Will this money be mine?

13:18.937 --> 13:19.937
On the right track.

13:20.017 --> 13:21.376
As expected of my boyfriend.

13:23.657 --> 13:24.657
It is for sure.

13:28.416 --> 13:29.496
Open it and check it out.

13:35.857 --> 13:36.897
I will open it.

13:36.897 --> 13:37.897
Just open it.

13:38.536 --> 13:39.536
Is that okay?

13:40.057 --> 13:41.657
Of course, we have no secrets.

13:42.857 --> 13:44.256
Why give you this?

13:44.857 --> 13:45.577
What else?

13:45.577 --> 13:46.577
A check?

13:49.617 --> 13:51.096
He wants to make it up to you.

13:51.416 --> 13:52.977
He should at least show some sincerity.

13:53.496 --> 13:54.817
After all those years of neglect,

13:54.897 --> 13:56.376
(Boxing tickets)
giving money is the least he could do.

13:59.577 --> 14:00.577
Is he good to you?

14:03.536 --> 14:04.536
Pretty good.

14:05.536 --> 14:06.536
Before,

14:06.737 --> 14:08.017
my mom often traveled for work.

14:08.496 --> 14:09.737
My dad was busy with work.

14:10.096 --> 14:11.577
It was Mr. Fu who played with me.

14:12.176 --> 14:14.017
He taught me how to ride a motorcycle.

14:14.416 --> 14:15.577
He's very patient.

14:16.017 --> 14:17.577
And he spoke humorously.

14:19.376 --> 14:21.817
When I was bullied before,
he always stood up for me.

14:22.697 --> 14:24.536
Then something happened to our family.

14:24.777 --> 14:26.336
Those years were the toughest.

14:26.617 --> 14:27.817
He helped us a lot

14:27.817 --> 14:29.136
with dealing with the bullies.

14:31.017 --> 14:32.057
So,

14:32.057 --> 14:34.216
when I heard my dad
say that about Mr. Fu,

14:34.496 --> 14:36.017
I can't believe he was bad before.

14:37.897 --> 14:38.897
Reformed man.

14:40.577 --> 14:41.577
I don't believe it.

14:45.536 --> 14:47.577
You have already known
what's inside, right?

14:49.416 --> 14:50.496
Do you want to see him then?

14:51.416 --> 14:52.416
Of course not.

15:11.136 --> 15:13.017
Why did you buy him boxing tickets?

15:15.057 --> 15:17.017
I'm just out of options.

15:17.017 --> 15:18.096
After thinking it over,

15:18.657 --> 15:19.657
I can simply

15:20.777 --> 15:22.577
let him give me a beating,

15:22.697 --> 15:23.937
and vent his anger on me.

15:23.937 --> 15:25.296
After that, it'll be over.

15:28.456 --> 15:31.376
This kid has quite a good physique.

15:31.977 --> 15:32.977
I heard that

15:33.176 --> 15:34.216
he plays basketball daily.

15:34.937 --> 15:36.336
How's your physique?

15:36.817 --> 15:38.536
My physique isn't bad either.

15:38.536 --> 15:40.657
I'm in the prime of life.

15:43.096 --> 15:44.216
Just kidding.

15:45.577 --> 15:47.096
Didn't I give him two tickets?

15:47.657 --> 15:49.296
Let him bring Xu Zhi along.

15:50.096 --> 15:51.216
As long as Xu Zhi comes,

15:51.617 --> 15:52.817
he'll definitely hold back.

15:54.216 --> 15:55.496
How could I possibly defeat him?

15:56.057 --> 15:57.057
I feel like

15:57.857 --> 15:59.376
he probably won't bother with you.

15:59.697 --> 16:00.697
Impossible.

16:02.697 --> 16:03.697
He's my son.

16:03.857 --> 16:04.937
I have a mental connection.

16:05.617 --> 16:07.376
He'll definitely bring Xu Zhi along.

16:10.176 --> 16:11.176
Alright.

16:11.376 --> 16:12.376
Good luck.

16:17.857 --> 16:19.336
I hope he won't beat me to a pulp.

16:20.977 --> 16:21.977
Mr. Xu is discharged tomorrow.

16:22.136 --> 16:23.857
The custom crutch will arrive tomorrow.

16:24.296 --> 16:25.376
I've borrowed the SUV

16:25.376 --> 16:26.456
from Zhu Yangqi's family.

16:26.456 --> 16:27.617
Mr. Xu can be comfortable.

16:28.096 --> 16:29.136
You and Cai Yingying

16:29.136 --> 16:30.857
are responsible for tidying up the ward.

16:31.176 --> 16:34.577
Alright. My boyfriend is so considerate.

16:34.817 --> 16:37.296
He's truly smitten with me.

16:38.017 --> 16:39.136
Is it possible that

16:39.136 --> 16:40.657
I am smitten with Mr. Xu instead?

16:40.657 --> 16:41.897
Luzhou, don't be cheeky.

16:43.416 --> 16:44.416
I'm serious.

16:45.416 --> 16:46.416
How about this?

16:46.496 --> 16:47.176
I won't pretend.

16:47.256 --> 16:48.256
Let's lay it all out.

16:48.496 --> 16:49.496
From now on,

16:49.577 --> 16:50.216
you love me,

16:50.496 --> 16:51.296
I love Mr. Xu,

16:51.456 --> 16:52.057
and Mr. Xu loves you.

16:52.296 --> 16:54.136
We three will conserve energy.

16:54.376 --> 16:56.496
Are you silly?

16:56.777 --> 16:57.777
Not as silly as you.

16:57.857 --> 16:58.496
You're silly.

16:58.577 --> 16:59.577
You're the silliest.

17:02.857 --> 17:03.416
Alright.

17:03.697 --> 17:04.697
Better go back now.

17:04.817 --> 17:06.017
Recently you've been at my place.

17:06.017 --> 17:07.017
Your dad knows that.

17:07.176 --> 17:08.336
How did he find out?

17:09.057 --> 17:10.336
I told you that you're silly.

17:11.136 --> 17:12.657
He calls your house every night

17:13.057 --> 17:14.176
to see if you've come home

17:14.176 --> 17:15.176
and what time you return.

17:16.176 --> 17:17.176
You didn't get any calls.

17:17.376 --> 17:18.376
No, I didn't.

17:33.256 --> 17:33.858
Hello, Dad.

17:33.858 --> 17:35.216
I was just finishing my homework.

17:40.216 --> 17:41.617
Chen Luzhou.

17:43.456 --> 17:44.456
Just call me brother.

17:44.737 --> 17:46.536
I can't stand you calling me Dad.

17:47.136 --> 17:48.256
And you're really silly.

17:49.017 --> 17:51.176
You're really boring.

17:51.777 --> 17:52.777
Is it over or not?

17:53.017 --> 17:54.017
Alright.

17:54.176 --> 17:55.256
Xu Zhi's boyfriend

17:55.256 --> 17:57.096
is the biggest fool in the world.

17:57.096 --> 17:58.096
Is that okay?

18:02.657 --> 18:04.017
Otherwise, you go

18:04.017 --> 18:05.577
to pick up Mr. Xu tomorrow.

18:06.937 --> 18:07.937
I have something.

18:10.536 --> 18:12.737
Xu and I will cook at home
and wait for you.

18:13.057 --> 18:14.057
Big fool.

18:15.136 --> 18:16.136
It startled me.

18:31.544 --> 18:34.904
(Boxing tickets)

18:44.977 --> 18:46.057
Did Chen Luzhou not come?

18:47.017 --> 18:48.416
He has something to settle.

18:50.017 --> 18:51.536
Then will you pick him up later?

18:51.817 --> 18:52.738
We agreed that

18:52.738 --> 18:54.536
we cook and wait for him at home.

18:54.977 --> 18:55.977
Still coming to eat?

18:56.416 --> 18:58.657
Then I have to take a round
at the market.

18:58.657 --> 18:59.657
Be careful.

19:00.777 --> 19:02.336
Don't waste the things on the table.

19:02.657 --> 19:03.697
Take all the fruits and flowers.

19:03.697 --> 19:04.336
I want all.

19:04.496 --> 19:05.496
I'll take them back.

19:05.496 --> 19:05.777
Okay.

19:05.777 --> 19:06.697
Bye, Mr. Xu.

19:06.697 --> 19:07.697
Bye.

19:08.857 --> 19:10.017
Despite his situation,

19:10.017 --> 19:11.017
he goes to buy food.

19:11.136 --> 19:13.096
He really treats Chen Luzhou
as his own son.

19:14.697 --> 19:15.817
He can't be his son.

19:15.817 --> 19:17.176
I was scared to death before.

19:17.296 --> 19:18.296
Exactly.

19:18.416 --> 19:20.617
I almost became
childhood sweethearts with him.

19:20.857 --> 19:21.176
Oh, my.

19:21.176 --> 19:22.057
Come on.

19:22.057 --> 19:23.296
Childhood sweethearts?

19:23.296 --> 19:24.737
I'll provide services for you two?

19:26.096 --> 19:27.376
Then...

19:27.617 --> 19:28.737
Do you want to take a break?

19:29.176 --> 19:30.376
I'll finish up.

19:30.977 --> 19:31.977
Please go ahead.

19:34.424 --> 19:37.508
(Sky Map Boxing)

19:58.937 --> 20:00.017
Why didn't Xu Zhi come?

20:00.697 --> 20:01.857
She went to pick up Mr. Xu.

20:04.336 --> 20:05.336
Well.

20:07.777 --> 20:10.017
Shall we talk somewhere else then?

20:10.937 --> 20:11.937
Chicken out?

20:14.136 --> 20:15.137
Weren't you prepared for being beaten

20:15.137 --> 20:16.256
after giving me the tickets?

20:32.697 --> 20:33.697
Come on.

20:37.737 --> 20:38.737
Come on.

20:40.216 --> 20:41.216
Nice punch.

20:46.296 --> 20:47.536
This punch is for my mom.

20:48.496 --> 20:50.136
Your fist is quite hard.

20:50.376 --> 20:51.376
Come on, continue.

21:10.136 --> 21:11.136
Hit me.

21:13.176 --> 21:14.657
What about the punch for yourself?

21:31.456 --> 21:32.657
Is it fun, Fu Yuqing?

21:36.496 --> 21:38.657
Some things can't be fixed
with a few punches.

21:41.937 --> 21:43.456
The best way for us to get along

21:43.456 --> 21:44.536
is to never meet again.

21:47.057 --> 21:48.057
Luzhou.

21:50.136 --> 21:51.536
I really

21:52.336 --> 21:54.216
never thought

21:56.176 --> 21:57.176
of abandoning you.

22:01.416 --> 22:03.096
I went to the orphanage to look for you.

22:03.096 --> 22:04.136
Really.

22:04.136 --> 22:05.136
So what?

22:05.817 --> 22:07.336
Should I thank you?

22:12.456 --> 22:13.456
Fu Yuqing.

22:14.617 --> 22:16.136
Just because you're a scumbag,

22:16.617 --> 22:18.416
my mom has been biased against me.

22:19.096 --> 22:20.536
When I said an extra word to a girl,

22:20.536 --> 22:21.857
she thought I would be like you,

22:22.256 --> 22:23.536
full of deceitful intentions.

22:25.897 --> 22:27.017
It's also because of you

22:28.017 --> 22:29.536
I was sent to the orphanage.

22:30.577 --> 22:32.256
I faced endless criticism there.

22:41.336 --> 22:43.176
I hadn't known you
for my first 18 years.

22:45.456 --> 22:47.136
But you messed up my life.

22:47.136 --> 22:48.577
Do you understand?

22:51.737 --> 22:53.336
Now you bought two boxing tickets

22:54.256 --> 22:55.617
to let me punch you a few times.

22:57.216 --> 22:58.657
Do you think it'll change anything?

23:32.017 --> 23:33.017
Forget it.

23:34.977 --> 23:35.977
I can forgive you.

23:38.817 --> 23:39.977
But that's irrelevant to you.

23:41.496 --> 23:42.977
It's because Xu Zhi told me

23:43.376 --> 23:44.376
that you treat her well.

23:46.256 --> 23:47.256
She likes you very much.

23:48.857 --> 23:50.136
I don't want her to be caught

23:50.136 --> 23:51.136
in the middle.

23:55.376 --> 23:56.257
Don't try to make up

23:56.257 --> 23:57.416
for our relationship.

23:58.737 --> 24:00.096
You'll only be her uncle.

24:01.577 --> 24:02.577
You will always be

24:03.496 --> 24:04.496
her uncle.

24:08.256 --> 24:09.937
If you want to make it up,

24:10.296 --> 24:11.336
then that person isn't me.

24:12.857 --> 24:13.857
It's Lian Hui.

24:52.296 --> 24:53.296
(Shy Boy Chen,)

24:53.416 --> 24:54.018
(if you don't come back soon,)

24:54.018 --> 24:55.256
(there'll be nothing left.)

25:11.977 --> 25:13.376
Let's move forward for now.

25:23.480 --> 25:26.840
♪On a midsummer night♪

25:27.288 --> 25:32.024
♪The drowsy streetlights
softly start to mend♪

25:33.688 --> 25:36.990
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

25:37.528 --> 25:42.319
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

25:43.832 --> 25:46.003
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

25:46.360 --> 25:48.622
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

25:48.984 --> 25:51.494
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

25:51.494 --> 25:54.223
♪The whole world pauses♪

25:54.776 --> 25:58.296
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

25:59.416 --> 26:01.944
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

26:01.944 --> 26:03.657
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

26:03.657 --> 26:05.336
(May his love be fulfilled.)

26:05.617 --> 26:07.017
(May all hatred dissipate.)

26:07.536 --> 26:09.256
(Whether turbulent waves)

26:09.456 --> 26:10.857
(or misty clouds,)

26:11.577 --> 26:13.017
(don't come near him.)

26:13.977 --> 26:17.017
(No mountains can stop him.)

26:17.697 --> 26:21.336
(May the boy from Yifeng Alley
always has the upper hand.)

26:27.832 --> 26:28.737
♪We met across billions of light-years♪

26:28.737 --> 26:29.737
Okay, Zhi.

26:30.216 --> 26:31.216
Wait for me to come home.

26:39.937 --> 26:40.937
The crabs are ready.

26:43.136 --> 26:44.176
They smell good.

26:46.977 --> 26:48.617
How come Luzhou is still not back yet?

26:48.617 --> 26:50.176
You've mentioned him three times.

26:50.376 --> 26:51.937
Why keep bringing up my boyfriend?

26:52.216 --> 26:53.817
He is more charming than you.

26:56.456 --> 26:57.136
Hold on.

26:57.136 --> 26:58.536
Wait until everyone is here.

26:59.176 --> 27:00.456
You've forgotten me,

27:00.456 --> 27:01.097
right?

27:01.097 --> 27:02.336
Alright, here's a crab leg.

27:03.577 --> 27:04.577
Where's your bowl?

27:04.857 --> 27:05.857
Here it is.

27:06.216 --> 27:07.857
Such a plump leg.

27:07.857 --> 27:09.617
I can eat it until next year.

27:10.176 --> 27:11.857
Be content, Yingying.

27:11.857 --> 27:13.336
She only gave me a crab shell.

27:13.336 --> 27:14.336
Serves you right.

27:14.697 --> 27:16.057
You haven't been married off yet.

27:16.057 --> 27:17.536
You're siding with Luzhou.

27:18.176 --> 27:19.456
I still love you the most.

27:22.416 --> 27:23.937
Sorry, I'm late.

27:24.456 --> 27:25.456
Chen Luzhou.

27:26.577 --> 27:27.216
You're here.

27:27.216 --> 27:28.216
Right.

27:29.416 --> 27:30.977
Ms. Wei bought you new slippers.

27:37.496 --> 27:37.937
Dad.

27:38.456 --> 27:40.176
Where should I
put the things Luzhou brought?

27:40.376 --> 27:41.176
Just put them there.

27:41.376 --> 27:42.657
You brought so many things.

27:43.697 --> 27:44.456
You're too kind.

27:44.456 --> 27:45.416
Why buy things?

27:45.416 --> 27:46.216
You're so kind.

27:46.216 --> 27:46.657
No.

27:46.657 --> 27:47.577
I brought some fruit.

27:47.577 --> 27:48.296
You sit there.

27:48.536 --> 27:49.376
Hurry up.

27:49.496 --> 27:50.256
Waiting for you.

27:50.336 --> 27:50.738
Sit down.

27:50.738 --> 27:52.496
Luzhou, this is my son, Wei Lin.

27:52.577 --> 27:53.057
Hello.

27:53.057 --> 27:54.057
Luzhou.

27:54.256 --> 27:55.057
Pour him a drink.

27:55.057 --> 27:56.136
Okay.

27:56.136 --> 27:57.136
Do you want orange juice?

27:58.416 --> 27:59.176
Thank you. I'll do it myself.

27:59.176 --> 28:00.176
It's okay, I'll do it.

28:00.697 --> 28:01.777
Uncle, Auntie, have a seat.

28:01.937 --> 28:02.376
Waiting for you.

28:02.496 --> 28:03.496
You sit first.

28:03.977 --> 28:04.977
It's my home.

28:06.136 --> 28:06.536
Sit down.

28:06.536 --> 28:07.136
Your home.

28:07.336 --> 28:07.777
You are

28:07.777 --> 28:08.657
the head.

28:08.777 --> 28:09.777
Thank you.

28:09.977 --> 28:10.977
Thank you.

28:12.136 --> 28:13.136
One dish is missing.

28:13.617 --> 28:14.018
No dish is missing.

28:14.018 --> 28:15.336
Slow down.

28:15.536 --> 28:16.217
It's okay.

28:16.217 --> 28:17.336
No need to help.

28:22.256 --> 28:23.256
- Give it to me.
- Okay.

28:24.577 --> 28:25.136
Here.

28:25.136 --> 28:26.136
Luzhou.

28:26.937 --> 28:28.697
You said you'll cook Kung Pao Chicken?

28:28.697 --> 28:29.376
There's chicken.

28:29.376 --> 28:30.376
What about the peanuts?

28:31.336 --> 28:32.416
You sit first.

28:33.657 --> 28:34.737
Zhi told me

28:35.817 --> 28:38.336
that you are a bit allergic to peanuts.

28:38.496 --> 28:39.897
Then starting from today,

28:39.897 --> 28:41.256
Xu's Kung Pao Chicken

28:41.376 --> 28:42.376
no longer has peanuts.

28:42.657 --> 28:43.657
Come on.

28:44.216 --> 28:45.216
Have a taste.

28:46.096 --> 28:47.577
Your father-in-law is thoughtful.

28:51.817 --> 28:52.817
Okay.

29:05.296 --> 29:06.296
How's the taste?

29:06.657 --> 29:07.136
Delicious.

29:07.136 --> 29:07.977
Delicious, right?

29:08.136 --> 29:08.577
Alright.

29:08.937 --> 29:10.577
Then this plain stir-fried chicken

29:10.577 --> 29:11.737
is especially for you.

29:14.857 --> 29:17.136
Aren't fathers-in-law
picky about sons-in-law?

29:17.336 --> 29:18.416
I think Mr. Xu

29:18.737 --> 29:20.777
treats Luzhou better than Xu Zhi.

29:21.256 --> 29:22.256
Of course not.

29:22.416 --> 29:23.737
The first time I met him,

29:23.857 --> 29:24.618
I found him annoying.

29:24.618 --> 29:26.496
He mysteriously came
to register with me,

29:26.777 --> 29:28.376
and even gave me a red envelope, right?

29:28.777 --> 29:29.777
Wait.

29:30.136 --> 29:31.897
Did he see you for a check-up?

29:32.176 --> 29:33.617
Luzhou registered for andrology?

29:35.057 --> 29:36.057
Yes.

29:40.577 --> 29:40.978
You kid.

29:40.978 --> 29:42.017
It was a misunderstanding.

29:42.617 --> 29:44.617
All the indicators were very normal.

29:45.057 --> 29:46.777
Luzhou, keep it up.

29:50.136 --> 29:51.977
Then here's to everyone's good health.

29:52.536 --> 29:53.977
- Good health.
- Good health.

29:54.536 --> 29:55.416
Good health.

29:55.416 --> 29:56.416
Dreams come true.

30:17.256 --> 30:18.577
Don't be mad.

30:19.336 --> 30:20.697
Xu didn't mean it.

30:22.977 --> 30:24.017
He told me everything.

30:24.216 --> 30:25.456
You were injured playing ball.

30:25.617 --> 30:26.817
You're in great health.

30:28.817 --> 30:29.817
He really said that?

30:31.456 --> 30:32.496
I hope he did say so.

30:38.496 --> 30:39.496
Stop messing around.

30:41.536 --> 30:42.536
Then I'll head back.

30:43.017 --> 30:44.777
Xu had drunk a lot today.

30:45.256 --> 30:46.456
I'm afraid he'll wake up at night.

30:46.536 --> 30:47.377
It's hard for him.

30:47.377 --> 30:48.416
I'll go take care of him.

30:50.256 --> 30:51.256
You're not allowed to go.

30:52.296 --> 30:53.296
Let him hold it in.

30:53.977 --> 30:55.496
What about the promised love for Xu?

30:56.296 --> 30:57.296
I can't afford to love.

31:04.344 --> 31:06.924
♪Like a breeze♪

31:07.832 --> 31:10.798
♪Drifting through the sky♪

31:11.544 --> 31:16.417
♪It wipes away
the trails of sorrow's sigh♪

31:18.424 --> 31:20.704
♪How many sceneries♪

31:21.912 --> 31:24.353
♪Have I passed by♪

31:25.464 --> 31:25.977
♪Waiting for a meeting♪

31:25.977 --> 31:26.977
Bye.

31:28.216 --> 31:29.216
Be careful.

31:29.416 --> 31:30.416
Turn off the lights.

31:31.160 --> 31:33.816
♪The heartbeat reminds♪

31:34.296 --> 31:37.624
♪The moment I hug you♪

31:37.880 --> 31:38.657
♪Let every chapter of the story♪

31:38.657 --> 31:39.416
(In recent years,)

31:39.617 --> 31:40.857
(our economy has been growing,)

31:41.096 --> 31:43.017
(becoming a stable pillar
of the global economy,)

31:43.176 --> 31:44.296
(and a growth engine.)

31:44.737 --> 31:46.376
(According to
the latest published data,)

31:46.536 --> 31:48.657
(our country's GDP last year)

31:48.657 --> 31:49.657
(reached a new high,)

31:49.977 --> 31:52.176
(maintaining a good trend
of stable growth.)

31:52.977 --> 31:54.057
(Morning news)
What's for lunch?

31:54.296 --> 31:55.296
Lunch?

31:55.536 --> 31:56.817
Should we ask Chen Luzhou?

31:57.017 --> 31:58.018
If he comes to eat,

31:58.018 --> 31:59.657
I can still go buy some food now.

31:59.817 --> 32:01.577
Does he still have the nerve
to see you now?

32:02.617 --> 32:03.617
He is so sensitive

32:03.617 --> 32:04.617
and shy.

32:05.577 --> 32:07.376
Isn't it because
you publicly punished him?

32:07.376 --> 32:10.057
It's actually good for boys
to be sensitive.

32:13.617 --> 32:14.617
Slow down.

32:15.336 --> 32:16.456
Are your socks on wrong side?

32:16.617 --> 32:17.617
No.

32:17.737 --> 32:18.737
It's all good.

32:19.176 --> 32:20.496
I'll go out with him in a while.

32:20.657 --> 32:22.496
Buy some stuff to take back to school.

32:24.536 --> 32:26.057
I think he is

32:26.057 --> 32:27.057
quite impressive.

32:27.057 --> 32:27.536
See,

32:27.897 --> 32:29.697
you two spent the winter break together.

32:30.256 --> 32:31.777
Still want to be together in Beijing?

32:32.617 --> 32:33.617
Aren't you tired of it?

32:34.336 --> 32:35.416
Of course not.

32:37.057 --> 32:38.057
Come on.

32:38.456 --> 32:39.456
Take these things

32:40.857 --> 32:41.496
back.

32:41.657 --> 32:42.296
What are they?

32:42.296 --> 32:43.256
So mysterious.

32:43.256 --> 32:44.256
See for yourself.

32:58.057 --> 32:59.057
Take them.

33:00.216 --> 33:01.216
I'll go to the kitchen

33:01.697 --> 33:03.096
and reheat breakfast.

33:14.216 --> 33:15.096
Are you happy now?

33:15.216 --> 33:16.216
Yes.

33:16.376 --> 33:17.737
We have a new family member,

33:17.737 --> 33:18.697
but Xu still thinks of me.

33:18.697 --> 33:19.697
Very happy.

33:20.617 --> 33:21.617
That's good.

33:23.737 --> 33:25.296
The dog previously named Lucy

33:25.296 --> 33:26.577
seems to have found a family.

33:27.857 --> 33:29.456
Why does it sound like you're scolding?

33:30.456 --> 33:31.456
Not at all.

33:33.977 --> 33:35.017
Do you know what

33:35.017 --> 33:36.577
the happiest thing is in the world?

33:36.817 --> 33:37.817
No idea.

33:38.096 --> 33:39.096
It's that

33:39.456 --> 33:41.496
everyone else on this street is single,

33:41.657 --> 33:42.897
but we're in a relationship.

33:43.256 --> 33:43.657
Right?

33:44.096 --> 33:45.096
Be a decent one.

33:45.296 --> 33:46.336
Say less if you don't want

33:46.336 --> 33:47.416
to get beaten up.

33:50.897 --> 33:52.176
Do you know what

33:52.176 --> 33:53.697
the most tragic thing is in the world?

33:54.937 --> 33:56.737
It's that everyone has an umbrella,

33:56.977 --> 33:58.096
but we don't.

34:08.176 --> 34:09.536
(Because of someone's presence,)

34:10.416 --> 34:12.176
(I no longer hate the rain.)

34:21.937 --> 34:22.937
Why did you come here?

34:24.937 --> 34:25.778
You won't come over.

34:25.778 --> 34:26.897
So, I have to come find you.

34:28.296 --> 34:30.496
Let's eat before school starts.

34:32.336 --> 34:33.336
I...

34:33.697 --> 34:34.697
Open the door.

34:35.216 --> 34:36.216
I've been waiting.

34:48.897 --> 34:49.897
Bring the food inside.

35:20.456 --> 35:21.456
Just order takeout.

35:22.017 --> 35:22.937
How can that be okay?

35:22.937 --> 35:23.818
I'm here.

35:23.818 --> 35:25.017
So, we must cook and eat.

35:25.577 --> 35:26.897
That's the healthy way.

35:29.536 --> 35:31.657
Don't cut your hand
when chopping those vegetables.

35:33.496 --> 35:34.817
You're underestimating me.

35:36.617 --> 35:38.216
Several of Ms. Mei's signature dishes

35:38.216 --> 35:39.416
were taught by me.

35:39.937 --> 35:41.256
You sure know

35:41.857 --> 35:43.216
how to boast.

35:56.256 --> 35:57.376
I heard that...

35:58.256 --> 35:59.857
I heard you went to find him.

36:03.136 --> 36:04.216
What did he say?

36:05.376 --> 36:06.376
He sought my forgiveness.

36:06.737 --> 36:07.737
What else could he say?

36:09.777 --> 36:10.777
What about you?

36:15.496 --> 36:16.496
I forgave him

36:17.777 --> 36:19.096
for Xu Zhi's sake.

36:21.176 --> 36:23.096
Did you hit him then?

36:25.456 --> 36:26.456
I did.

36:27.176 --> 36:28.176
For both you and myself.

36:28.937 --> 36:30.136
I beat him up well.

36:35.777 --> 36:37.296
Did you break his hand then?

36:44.617 --> 36:45.617
That's good then.

36:46.376 --> 36:47.577
Last time he told me that

36:47.577 --> 36:47.978
in the future,

36:47.978 --> 36:50.336
Fu Yu Villa is yours.

36:53.336 --> 36:56.176
You should leave him one hand
to sign the contract.

36:57.336 --> 36:58.777
I'm not interested in that.

37:00.536 --> 37:01.536
Are you stupid?

37:02.336 --> 37:03.336
If you're not interested,

37:03.897 --> 37:05.017
you can leave it to Xu Zhi.

37:19.897 --> 37:20.897
Let me do it.

37:23.057 --> 37:24.057
What are you doing?

37:24.536 --> 37:25.536
Cooking.

37:25.857 --> 37:27.057
It'll be dawn when you're done.

37:28.456 --> 37:29.456
Wait,

37:30.096 --> 37:31.496
where did you learn your skills?

37:32.136 --> 37:33.897
When my future father-in-law was hurt,

37:33.897 --> 37:34.897
I cooked every day.

37:35.737 --> 37:37.216
Stop making things up.

37:37.376 --> 37:38.496
What future father-in-law?

37:38.857 --> 37:40.737
Xu Zhi hasn't agreed to marry you yet.

37:41.296 --> 37:42.296
Too overconfident.

37:42.456 --> 37:43.737
How do you know she's unwilling?

37:45.057 --> 37:46.096
Do you know her well?

37:49.897 --> 37:50.336
Right,

37:50.657 --> 37:52.897
when you went to Beijing
to pick up Chen Xingqi,

37:53.256 --> 37:54.536
what did you say to Xu Zhi?

37:55.657 --> 37:56.977
You're close to her.

37:57.136 --> 37:58.136
Go ask her.

37:58.817 --> 37:59.817
I don't know.

38:00.977 --> 38:01.416
Forget it.

38:01.897 --> 38:02.617
Turn down the heat.

38:02.617 --> 38:03.058
The pot will burn.

38:03.058 --> 38:04.937
Stop making trouble for me, okay?

38:04.937 --> 38:06.296
Just sit and wait for the meal.

38:06.296 --> 38:07.136
Stir quickly.

38:07.136 --> 38:07.938
It's going to burn.

38:07.938 --> 38:09.296
Look, it's smoking.

38:09.697 --> 38:10.657
Hurry up.

38:10.657 --> 38:11.497
Hurry up.

38:11.497 --> 38:12.737
Alright, you do it.

38:26.937 --> 38:28.456
(Chen Xingqi)
(It's hard to find an essay book)

38:28.456 --> 38:29.817
(without Luzhou's essay in it.)

38:30.416 --> 38:31.416
(Chen Luzhou.)

38:31.617 --> 38:33.697
(Give me a way out.)

38:37.937 --> 38:39.496
(There is no real despair,)

38:40.697 --> 38:42.456
(only prisoners of their thoughts.)

38:46.859 --> 38:50.520
(There is no real despair,
only prisoners of their thoughts.)

38:58.176 --> 38:59.176
What are you looking at?

39:06.057 --> 39:07.136
You've fallen in love with me.

39:07.256 --> 39:08.256
Here we go again.

39:14.657 --> 39:15.857
Are you childish or not?

39:16.296 --> 39:17.336
Not as childish as you.

39:18.496 --> 39:19.617
The puppy wags its tail.

39:22.777 --> 39:24.136
I downloaded a movie.

39:25.136 --> 39:27.136
I heard it makes everyone cry.

39:27.456 --> 39:28.456
Do you want to watch it?

39:28.577 --> 39:29.577
No.

39:30.296 --> 39:31.456
That's no fun.

39:31.456 --> 39:32.456
Use it to discipline me?

39:36.336 --> 39:37.376
Who is it?

39:37.376 --> 39:38.017
Ms. Qu.

39:38.296 --> 39:39.058
She wants me

39:39.058 --> 39:41.096
to share College Entrance
Examination experiences

39:41.216 --> 39:42.657
at Ruijun School's
coming-of-age ceremony.

39:43.216 --> 39:44.296
I would like to hear

39:44.296 --> 39:45.777
your speech.

39:47.296 --> 39:48.296
On the 21st?

39:49.737 --> 39:50.977
I might be in Beijing by then.

39:51.176 --> 39:52.456
Professor Bai asked Li Ke and me

39:52.456 --> 39:54.937
to conduct an exchange on the college
math modeling competition.

39:56.376 --> 39:57.977
But your speech is also important.

39:57.977 --> 39:59.697
Stop, did you forget what I said?

40:01.296 --> 40:03.456
Chen Luzhou, let's move forward for now.

40:06.456 --> 40:07.456
Alright.

40:07.697 --> 40:08.697
See you at school.

40:13.496 --> 40:14.937
(Being youth, welcome new semester)

40:14.937 --> 40:18.697
Next, let's welcome the outstanding
graduate representative, Xu Zhi,

40:18.697 --> 40:19.697
to the stage to speak.

40:28.977 --> 40:30.817
Learning is limitless,
hardship is the vessel.

40:30.817 --> 40:32.496
Plum blossoms' fragrance
arises from the bitter cold.

40:32.737 --> 40:34.897
As long as we don't stop moving forward,

40:34.897 --> 40:36.817
we can see the light of dawn.

40:38.657 --> 40:40.777
Does anyone want to oppose me
when I say this?

40:41.096 --> 40:42.096
Please.

40:42.256 --> 40:43.657
The light of dawn remains still.

40:43.657 --> 40:45.096
We can see it while lying down.

40:45.416 --> 40:46.416
That's right.

40:46.496 --> 40:48.256
When I sat below the stage like you,

40:48.256 --> 40:49.096
I would also think

40:49.096 --> 40:50.416
why we are sitting here

40:50.416 --> 40:51.416
while listening to this.

40:54.136 --> 40:56.336
So today, let's talk
something practical.

40:58.496 --> 41:00.937
Like how late we can stay up
without looking

41:01.456 --> 41:02.617
as if we are haunted

41:02.617 --> 41:04.176
by a ghost.

41:05.136 --> 41:06.136
Like how late we can be

41:06.336 --> 41:07.336
before the braised ribs

41:07.536 --> 41:09.057
in the second-floor cafeteria

41:09.057 --> 41:10.577
lose the appeal to us.

41:13.860 --> 41:15.999
(Go for it, Zhi)

41:17.897 --> 41:19.096
After discussing practical ones,

41:19.096 --> 41:20.416
let's move on to forbidden ones.

41:20.897 --> 41:22.057
For example, young love.

41:26.977 --> 41:28.937
I know this is a sensitive word.

41:29.256 --> 41:31.176
Avoiding the topic won't

41:31.176 --> 41:32.416
make it disappear, right?

41:33.296 --> 41:35.376
However, I personally believe

41:35.376 --> 41:37.017
that you should spend

41:37.017 --> 41:38.216
precious three years

41:38.216 --> 41:39.577
of high school on studying.

41:39.897 --> 41:41.336
Because this seems to be

41:41.336 --> 41:43.697
the most cost-effective
and rewarding thing to do.

41:44.216 --> 41:44.697
Of course.

41:44.937 --> 41:46.817
If you unfortunately fall in love,

41:46.977 --> 41:48.176
don't feel ashamed either.

41:48.456 --> 41:49.337
Because liking someone

41:49.337 --> 41:51.536
is never a shameful thing.

41:52.376 --> 41:54.617
You can turn your affection
into a motivation.

41:54.857 --> 41:56.777
But you can't let others'
lack of affection make

41:56.777 --> 41:57.937
you feel sorry for yourself.

41:57.937 --> 42:00.496
Because he might only like himself.

42:01.496 --> 42:05.017
The above statements
only represent my personal viewpoint,

42:05.017 --> 42:06.456
not related to the school's position.

42:07.977 --> 42:09.376
Please don't record videos,

42:09.376 --> 42:10.657
and don't upload them online.

42:10.817 --> 42:12.456
If it accidentally goes viral,

42:12.657 --> 42:14.456
Ruijun School will raise
the tuition fees.

42:14.777 --> 42:16.296
Then it will be tough for you all.

42:17.416 --> 42:18.697
Anyway, just kidding.

42:18.697 --> 42:20.057
I still want to say

42:20.496 --> 42:22.216
a bit pretentious but sincere words.

42:22.697 --> 42:23.658
When I was a first-year student,

42:23.658 --> 42:25.336
I also went through a low point.

42:25.336 --> 42:27.857
I felt very bleak about the future
at that time.

42:28.136 --> 42:30.136
And no matter what I did,

42:30.256 --> 42:31.256
I felt no enthusiasm.

42:31.536 --> 42:33.657
Later, I accidentally heard a saying.

42:34.057 --> 42:35.937
There is no real despair,

42:35.937 --> 42:38.057
only prisoners of their thoughts.

42:44.136 --> 42:46.657
At that moment, I understood

42:47.057 --> 42:48.256
we can be very small.

42:48.256 --> 42:49.657
But we can also be great.

42:52.216 --> 42:53.937
If your hearts are like steel,

42:53.937 --> 42:56.096
then they will heat up
fiercely in the sun.

42:56.897 --> 42:58.017
As long as the sun rises,

42:58.017 --> 42:59.376
we will always have the future.

43:00.336 --> 43:01.977
In those rainy days,

43:01.977 --> 43:03.777
we can wring out our clothes.

43:03.777 --> 43:04.817
It can still go on.

43:04.817 --> 43:06.057
As for whether it's happy

43:06.057 --> 43:07.136
or sad,

43:07.296 --> 43:08.536
or with hopefulness,

43:08.536 --> 43:09.857
or without expectations,

43:10.057 --> 43:11.176
we can get through it.

43:12.017 --> 43:13.897
In the end,
it is us who choose the world,

43:13.897 --> 43:15.817
and not the world that chooses us.

43:16.256 --> 43:17.977
Finally, I'd like to share a phrase.

43:17.977 --> 43:19.336
It's my boyfriend's favorite.

43:23.336 --> 43:25.336
There are endless ages and vast lands.

43:25.536 --> 43:28.017
The future is bright,
and the days ahead are long.

43:28.216 --> 43:29.216
Thank you.

43:30.256 --> 43:31.577
Zhi is the best.

43:31.697 --> 43:32.977
Zhi is the greatest.

43:38.017 --> 43:40.176
How did your senior Xu Zhi
do with her speech?

43:40.496 --> 43:41.657
Good.

43:42.216 --> 43:44.096
You could only hear part of it.

43:44.336 --> 43:46.456
Alright, let's proceed to the next one.

43:47.136 --> 43:49.536
Brave through thorns to move forward.

43:49.977 --> 43:52.777
Sing and move on without hesitation.

43:53.296 --> 43:55.577
All third-year students,
please stand up.

43:57.817 --> 43:58.937
Raise your right fist.

44:00.017 --> 44:02.577
I swear in the name of youth.

44:02.897 --> 44:05.697
I swear in the name of youth.

44:05.817 --> 44:07.536
In our youthful days.

44:07.897 --> 44:10.057
In our youthful days.

44:10.697 --> 44:11.937
At eighteen, we have our aspirations.

44:12.496 --> 44:14.096
At eighteen, we have our aspirations.

44:14.376 --> 44:15.737
The splendor of youth.

44:15.937 --> 44:17.456
The splendor of youth.

44:17.657 --> 44:19.017
Assuming great responsibilities.

44:19.216 --> 44:20.697
Assuming great responsibilities.

44:20.857 --> 44:22.136
Our dreams set sail.

44:22.136 --> 44:23.977
Didn't we agree to move forward?

44:23.977 --> 44:25.057
Why look back now?

44:25.657 --> 44:27.857
I just happened to find
a discounted plane ticket.

44:28.536 --> 44:29.617
So I thought I'd come back.

44:30.136 --> 44:31.096
Reimbursable, Zhi?

44:31.096 --> 44:32.096
In your dreams.

44:33.697 --> 44:35.336
Right here for the announcement.

44:36.096 --> 44:37.096
It's worth it.

44:39.496 --> 44:42.216
Spur on to forge a brilliant future.

44:42.296 --> 44:45.536
Spur on to forge a brilliant future.

44:48.888 --> 44:52.531
♪With you, I actually
start looking forward to rainy days♪

44:52.888 --> 44:57.683
♪You are like an umbrella,
always catching the raindrops♪

44:57.683 --> 45:01.395
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

45:01.560 --> 45:05.181
♪Only passionate love
like a ray of sunshine♪

45:05.181 --> 45:07.577
♪Can beat the night♪

45:07.672 --> 45:11.318
♪We can outrun time♪

45:11.832 --> 45:15.206
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

45:15.704 --> 45:19.704
♪All blend into our season♪

45:19.823 --> 45:22.556
(We are both small and great.)

45:23.448 --> 45:26.616
(Because our hearts are like steel,)

45:26.616 --> 45:32.569
(they will heat up fiercely in the sun.)

45:33.784 --> 45:39.600
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

45:40.152 --> 45:45.680
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

45:47.192 --> 45:51.640
♪The world is too quiet♪

45:52.632 --> 45:59.560
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

46:00.472 --> 46:05.560
♪Who will visit me♪

46:06.616 --> 46:12.240
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

46:12.984 --> 46:16.040
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

46:16.280 --> 46:21.600
♪Into concern and care♪

46:27.128 --> 46:32.240
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

46:32.760 --> 46:38.600
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

46:40.056 --> 46:43.440
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

46:43.576 --> 46:49.800
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

46:50.296 --> 46:53.240
♪The lonely clock♪

46:53.400 --> 46:58.000
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

46:58.392 --> 47:01.640
♪Are we both♪

47:01.912 --> 47:05.440
♪Attracted to each other♪

47:06.584 --> 47:13.200
♪Falling into you♪

47:16.920 --> 47:22.720
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

47:23.576 --> 47:26.240
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

47:26.776 --> 47:31.400
♪From reaching eternity♪

47:31.800 --> 47:35.080
♪After rushing recklessly♪

47:35.288 --> 47:38.720
♪We approach each other♪

47:39.992 --> 47:43.600
♪Without turning back♪

47:44.984 --> 47:52.640
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

47:53.272 --> 47:59.760
♪Falling into you♪
